msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/bells-inequality-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/7339b9d8-2508-4821-8823-264b8c7afdad-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$H$ Hadamard gate: Creates a superposition state. Single-qubit gate.\n"
"$$\n"
"H|0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle\\right),\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"H|1\\rangle = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"H=\\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$H$ Hadamard Gate: יוצר מצב סופרפוזיציה. Gate חד-Qubit.\n"
"$$\n"
"H|0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle\\right),\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"H|1\\rangle = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"H=\\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

