msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/bells-inequality-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/7242ff98-867d-4e61-ab66-81920bb132ec-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that the first qubit listed in `qc.cx(0,1)` is the control, and the second is the target. Diagrammatically, the target is the one with the \"+\" sign or cross on it.\n"
msgstr "שים לב שה-Qubit הראשון שמצוין ב-`qc.cx(0,1)` הוא הבקר, והשני הוא המטרה. בתרשים, המטרה היא זו עם סימן ה-\"+\" או ה-X עליה.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$R_y(\\theta)$ Rotation Y gate: Rotates the state about the y-axis. This is a single-qubit gate.\n"
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta)|0\\rangle = \\cos(\\theta/2)|0\\rangle+\\sin(\\theta/2)|1\\rangle,\\\\R_y(\\theta)|0\\rangle = -\\sin(\\theta/2)|0\\rangle+\\cos(\\theta/2)|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta)=\\begin{bmatrix} \\cos(\\theta/2) & -\\sin(\\theta/2) \\\\ \\sin(\\theta/2) & \\cos(\\theta/2) \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$R_y(\\theta)$ Rotation Y Gate: מסובב את המצב סביב ציר ה-y. זהו Gate חד-Qubit.\n"
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta)|0\\rangle = \\cos(\\theta/2)|0\\rangle+\\sin(\\theta/2)|1\\rangle,\\\\R_y(\\theta)|0\\rangle = -\\sin(\\theta/2)|0\\rangle+\\cos(\\theta/2)|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta)=\\begin{bmatrix} \\cos(\\theta/2) & -\\sin(\\theta/2) \\\\ \\sin(\\theta/2) & \\cos(\\theta/2) \\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
